      "A black-and-white postcard photograph of a formal cemetery garden with rows of gravestones and carefully trimmed hedges, leading up to a large stone church. The text on the card indicates the location as Borna, near Leipzig, and refers to a 'Heldenfriedhof' (which translates as 'heroes' cemetery'). The visual tone and quality suggest an early-to-mid 20th-century period."
